The folder sebaro/ next to this file is the sebaro design export, fetched by
its own updater (sebaro/checks/update-copy.mjs) and never edited here
(docs/sebaro-umbau.md, docs/sebaro-luecken.md Z14, ADR-0051). It is not under
this repository's licence.
Its terms are in sebaro/LICENSE.md: MIT for the CSS, tokens, icons and
scripts; SIL Open Font License 1.1 for the fonts (texts in sebaro/fonts/web/);
all rights reserved for the name sebaro, the signs, tiles and app icons.
